From e6781be17737d80f0097ce3d9d9cfff789b5aadb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lian <unfazing@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:34:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(security): preserve agent management isolation

Apply the permanent nftables boundary through the Hermes deployment while preserving administrator return traffic. Keep one-time campaign procedures outside the active operator interface.
---
 ansible/playbooks/hermes.yml                  |  2 +
